                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A decent visual novel with extensive use of clipping mask technique. I really liked the soundtrack, and visual style.\nDialogs and cutscenes are okay, the story is a bit macabre, but leaves quite a bit of questions unanswered. There are several gags here which make the overall tone shift to somewhat whimsical at times, which creates a nice contrast.\n\nThe animations are rough, the hands are genuinely scary, especially for Eku, really misguided me about her in the beginning.\n\nOverall a unique game, recommended for any VN fan.",
